    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nOne (double) bedroom, one bathroom apartment at Glenmalure Square, Milltown available to rent immediately\n\nA bright and spacious one-bedroom apartment which benefits from a large south-facing balcony. Located in this popular development, it is an excellent location close to the City Centre and with both Milltown and Ranelagh villages a short walk with a host of amenities they each offer. \n\nThere is very good public transport on hand and the LUAS is minutes away. This is a bright and spacious one-bedroom apartment to the front of the development with access to the communal gardens, which are well maintained. There is also communal car parking available. This property commands a most desirable location. The bus stop (44 & 48) is located immediately outside the development on the Milltown Road, the Luas station is a short walk away, Dundrum Shopping Centre is a short drive away, the Milltown Centre is immediately across the road with a pharmacy, creche, hair & beauty salon, coffee shop and a large Spar supermarket and the M50 is also within easy driving distance. \n\n*Parking icluded*\n \nViewing is highly recommended!"
      },
